# W7D2 - Haystack Retrieval: BM25 & Dense Retrieval

## Objective

Build and compare BM25 and Dense retrieval methods using Haystack.

## Technologies

- Python
- Haystack 3.0.0
- Sentence Transformers
- InMemoryDocumentStore
- BM25 Retriever
- Dense Embedding Retriever

