## BM25 Pipeline

PDF Documents
→ PyPDFToDocument
→ InMemoryDocumentStore
→ InMemoryBM25Retriever
→ Retrieved Documents

## Dense Retrieval Pipeline

PDF Documents
→ PyPDFToDocument
→ Sentence Transformers
→ InMemoryDocumentStore
→ InMemoryEmbeddingRetriever
→ Retrieved Documents

## Evaluation

Both methods were tested using the same five PDF documents and the same ten questions.

BM25 uses keyword-based retrieval, while Dense retrieval uses semantic embeddings.

The results were manually inspected and compared.

